{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《玄戰》昨晚（3日）請來曾展望（GM）及Sophie擔任嘉賓，雖然GM為保持神秘感而蒙面登場，卻因個人特徵太過明顯，被網民秒速認出，場面搞笑！而他與女友Sophie在節目中更瘋狂放閃，GM一句「自殺式」情話更令Sophie啼笑皆非，閃爆全場！</p><p>GM蒙面太易認 網民笑言：一望就知</p><p>在昨晚的第一條題目中，4位黑先知需要從三位面具男中，找出哪一位是Sophie的戀人。雖然GM戴上了面具，但他標誌性的髮型和眼神實在太易認，結果被眼利觀眾一眼看穿。網民紛紛笑言：「一睇個髮型同隻眼，戴咗面具都估到邊個」、「真係一望就知係 GM」。難怪連主持都笑稱這條是熱身題，最終4位黑先知亦全部成功答中。</p><p>Sophie開心飛撲GM 甜蜜互動閃爆全場</p><p>節目中最甜蜜的一幕，莫過於Sophie揭曉GM身份的時刻。當Sophie確認面具男A就是GM時，她臉上掛著藏不住的甜笑，更興奮得直接飛撲到GM身上，兩人恩愛之情溢於言表。這個充滿愛意的舉動，瞬間讓現場氣氛變得極度甜蜜，閃瞎一眾觀眾。</p><p>GM「自殺式」情話辣㷫Sophie：可能係你自己撲埋嚟！</p><p>除了甜蜜互動，兩人的搞笑對話亦是節目一大亮點。GM先是發揮其「求生欲」，大讚女友：「我幾時都話 Sophie 係我嘅人生導師，佢教識我好多嘢」。不過，當Sophie搞笑問他：「你對我落咗啲咩法呢？」GM竟抵死地「自殺式」回應：「可能係你自己撲埋嚟！」這句情話令Sophie當場啼笑皆非，場面十分搞笑。</p><p>網民睇到勁投入：呢對好Sweet！</p><p>GM與Sophie的甜蜜互動成功俘虜大批網民，不少人留言大讚二人非常合襯，互動既可愛又搞笑。網民紛紛表示：「GM求生欲好低，笑死！」、「Sophie個飛撲好sweet呀！閃死人咩！」、「呢對真係好可愛，睇到好開心。」、「估唔到玄學節目都有得睇人放閃，哈哈！」。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/02_12487021116a9a4d7171c6a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/03_7138450606a9a4d74e3e40.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/04_13232493806a9a4d786291a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/05_21189413886a9a4d7e5012c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/06_17901969886a9a4d834da31.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/07_5160577106a9a4d86f2633.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/08_3171850546a9a4d8a33471.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/09_8512425736a9a4d8e11d72.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/10_13626034176a9a4d928dbfd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/11_4272624036a9a4d964d865.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/12_2025859276a9a4d9aeedb3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/13_10882800266a9a4d9fbf95b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/14_17630880516a9a4da3923b1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/15_16266004346a9a4da7244f2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/16_11846184496a9a4daadc629.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17_11660903686a9a4dae76551.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/18_17111564566a9a4db24913a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/19_2088787886a9a4db549aa2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20_14484778696a9a4db8885d1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/21_8893340666a9a4dbb84000.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/22_13104821186a9a4dbea561f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/23_5882406056a9a4dc1d3c6c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/24_10450275846a9a4dc6270a1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/25_1874375316a9a4dca12c5a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/26_7899357066a9a4dcdeb413.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/27_9730546996a9a4dd1af3ab.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/28_20598751676a9a4dd5b9b05.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/29_5893296866a9a4dda55b85.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30_10887820496a9a4ddf0ba22.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/31_9199620846a9a4de233092.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/32_3729995616a9a4de60957c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/33_5286144196a9a4de99f7ca.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/34_13265533206a9a4ded4d7f1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/35_18846179576a9a4df0d45cd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>還有什麼演唱會消息？</p><p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇： 演唱會時間表及購票資訊 ，包括 MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排 、 容祖兒 、 鄭秀文 、 張學友 、 鄭中基 、 溫拿 、 羅志祥 等。</p><p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？</p><p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看 Netflix劇集 和 BL劇 最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些 室內好去處 室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇： 離島行程攻略 或是行山，這些 行山好去處 路線簡易，新手也適合。</p><p>Tags : Sophie tvb即時資訊 曾展望 玄戰</p><p>圖片來源：TVB 資料或影片來源： 原文刊於新假期</p><p>Sep 4 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T06:19:57.000286+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1159,"images":34,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}